  "code": "#============================以下为描述头定义==========================\nV: 1.0\nB: Auld Lang Syne\nB: (Scottish New Year Song)\nZ: Traditional folk melody\nD: F\nP: 4/4\nJ: 90\n#============================以下开始简谱主体==========================\nQ: 6&zkh |: (5. 3/) (3 1) | 2. 1/ 2 6 | (5. 3/) (3 5) | 6 - - 1' |\nQ: 5. 3/ 3 1 | 2. 1/ 2 3 | 1. 6,/ 6, 5, | 1 - - 8&ykh\nC: \nQ1: 5 | 8 1'.\"[1]\" 1'/ 8 1' 8 3' | 2'. 8 1'/ 8 2' 3' | 1'. 8 1'/ 8 3' 8 8 5' | 6' - - 6' |\nQ2: 5 | 8 3. 3/ 8 5 8 5 | 4. 8 3/ 8 4 5 | 3. 8 3/ 8 5 8 8 1' | 1' - - 1' |\nC1: Should @old /ac- @quain- @tance /be @for- @got~, and /ne- @ver @brought @@to /mind~? Should\nC5: And @here~'~s a @hand @my /trus- @ty @friend~! And /give @a @hand @@of /thine~! And we~'~l~l\n# C2: And @sure- /ly @you~'~l~l @buy /your @pint @cup~! And /sure- @ly /I~'~l~l @buy /mine~! And we~'~l~l\n# C3: We @two /have @run @a- bout @the @hills~, and /picked @the /dai- @sies /fine~; But we~'~v~e \n# C4: We @two /have @pad- @dled /in @the @stream~, from /mor- @ning /sun @till /dine~; But\nQ3: 5 | 8 5. 5/ 8 5 8 5 | 7. 8 7/ 8 7 5 | 1'. 8 5/ 8 5 8 8 1' | 1' - - 1' |\nQ4: 5 | 8 1. 1/ 8 3 8 1 | 5. 8 5/ 8 5 5 | 1. 8 1/ 8 1 8 8 3 | 4 - - 4 |\n \nQ1: 5'.\"[5]\" 3'/ 8 3' 1' | 2'. 1'/ 2' 3' | 1'. 6/ 6 5 | 1' - - 6' |\nQ2: 5. 5/ 8 5 3 | 4. 3/ 4 5 | 3. 3/ 4 4 | 3 - - 1' |\nC1: old /ac- @quain- /tance /be /for- /got~, and /days /of /auld /lang /syne~? For\n#C2: take /a @cup /of /kind- /ness /yet~, for /days /of /auld /lang /syne~. For\n#C3: wan- /dered @ma- /ny a /wea- /ry /foot~, since /days /of /auld /lang /syne~. For\n#C4: seas /be- @tween /us /broad /have /roared /since /days /of /auld /lang /syne~. For\nC5: take /a @right /good- /will- /y /draught~, for /days /of /auld /lang /syne~. For\nQ3: 1'. 5/ 8 5 1' | 7. 6/ 7 1' | 6. 7/ 1' 7 | 1' - - 1' |\nQ4: 3. 1/ 8 1 3 | 5. 5/ 5 3 | 6. 6/ 4 5 | 1 - - 4 |\n\nQ1:  (5'.\"[9]\" 3'/) 8 (3' 1') | 2'. 1'/ 8 2' 6' | (5'. 3'/) 8 3' 5' | 6' - - 8 6' | 5'. 3'/ 8 3' 1' |\nQ2:  (1'. 5/) 8 (5 3) | 4. 3/ 8 4 1' |